ent="v1" begin="01:07.120" end="01:10.840"><span begin="01:07.120" end="01:07.385">I</span><span begin="01:07.385" end="01:07.650">’</span><span begin="01:07.650" end="01:07.915">m </span><span begin="01:07.915" end="01:08.180">not </span><span begin="01:08.180" end="01:08.445">satisfied </span><span begin="01:08.445" end="01:08.710">but </span><span begin="01:08.710" end="01:08.975">I</span><span begin="01:08.975" end="01:09.240">’</span><span begin="01:09.240" end="01:09.505">m </span><span begin="01:09.505" end="01:09.770">sleeping </span><span begin="01:09.770" end="01:10.035">on </span><span begin="01:10.035" end="01:10.300">a </span><span begin="01:10.300" end="01:10.565">train </span><span begin="01:10.565" end="01:10.840">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.870" end="01:16.810"><span begin="01:10.870" end="01:11.530">Point </span><span begin="01:11.530" end="01:12.130">out </span><span begin="01:12.130" end="01:12.760">the </span><span begin="01:12.760" end="01:13.570">fault </span><span begin="01:13.570" end="01:14.290">that </span><span begin="01:14.290" end="01:14.680">made </span><span begin="01:14.680" end="01:14.980">you </span><span begin="01:14.980" end="01:15.370">want </span><span begin="01:15.370" end="01:15.700">to </span><span begin="01:15.700" end="01:16.810">quit</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.170" end="01:19.930"><span begin="01:17.170" end="01:17.410">I</span><span begin="01:17.410" end="01:17.440">’</span><span begin="01:17.440" end="01:17.470">ll </span><span begin="01:17.470" end="01:17.920">cope </span><span begin="01:17.920" end="01:18.280">with </span><span begin="01:18.280" end="01:18.490">the </span><span begin="01:18.490" end="01:19.930">shame</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.020" end="01:22.510"><span begin="01:20.020" end="01:20.320">I </span><span begin="01:20.320" end="01:20.800">might </span><span begin="01:20.800" end="01:21.130">deal </span><span begin="01:21.130" end="01:21.610">with </span><span begin="01:21.610" end="01:22.510">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.540" end="01:28.750"><span begin="01:22.540" end="01:22.960">For </span><span begin="01:22.960" end="01:23.260">your </span><span begin="01:23.260" end="01:23.770">friends </span><span begin="01:23.770" end="01:24.070">who </span><span begin="01:24.070" end="01:25.240">refused </span><span begin="01:25.240" end="01:25.870">to </span><span begin="01:25.870" end="01:26.290">cough </span><span begin="01:26.290" end="01:26.620">up </span><span begin="01:26.620" end="01:26.950">their </span><span begin="01:26.950" end="01:28.750">goodbyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.810" end="01:31.390"><span begin="01:28.810" end="01:28.990">I</span><span begin="01:28.990" end="01:29.020">’</span><span begin="01:29.020" end="01:29.080">d </span><span begin="01:29.080" end="01:29.500">see </span><span begin="01:29.500" end="01:29.920">you </span><span begin="01:29.920" end="01:30.100">all </span><span begin="01:30.100" end="01:31.390">soon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.600" end="01:36.250"><span begin="01:31.600" end="01:32.050">If </span><span begin="01:32.050" end="01:32.410">I </span><span begin="01:32.410" end="01:33.040">never </span><span begin="01:33.040" end="01:36.250">lied</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.370" end="01:42.400"><span begin="01:39.370" end="01:39.610">Look </span><span begin="01:39.610" end="01:39.790">what </span><span begin="01:39.790" end="01:39.850">you </span><span begin="01:39.850" end="01:40.300">started</span><span begin="01:40.300" end="01:40.300">, </span><span begin="01:40.300" end="01:40.630">by </span><span begin="01:40.630" end="01:41.470">ignoring </span><span begin="01:41.470" end="01:41.650">all </span><span begin="01:41.650" end="01:41.830">the </span><span begin="01:41.830" end="01:42.400">signs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.400" end="01:45.400"><span begin="01:42.400" end="01:42.490">You </span><span begin="01:42.490" end="0